diode_isr: F31 (R95): one diode reverse-biased at -2 V whose model gives a recombination current (isr=1e-9, nr=2): VACASK carries it under reverse bias, ngspice-45 does not, so the current of vd differs by nanoamps; diode_noisr is the same deck without isr (the IR owner's families/diode_load/nom_rev_dc, isr raised from 1e-12 to stand above step 4's floor)
load "spice/diode.osdi"
model vs vsource
model nm sp_diode is=1e-14 n=1.05 rs=5 bv=5 ibv=1e-6 ikf=10m cjo=1p vj=0.7 m=0.4 fc=0.5 tt=1n xti=3 eg=1.11 isr=1e-9 nr=2
vd (d 0) vs dc=-2.0
d1 (d 0) nm area=2
control
  analysis op1 op
endc
